  - created_at: "2026-10-20T00:38:53.800Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: "Final tracker checks: pm health --strict-exit passes all 10 checks with zero warnings, pending merge decisions or history drift. pm validate --json is ok for all 9 items but reports 11 branch-provenance trust advisories on existing linked commands whose recorded source reference differs from the review branch. These are advisory command-trust warnings, distinct from tracker authority and release-gate results; existing provenance and append-only history are retained."
  - created_at: "2026-10-20T02:47:07.028Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: "Review round: fetched all unresolved PR #1 threads and complete comments; two findings remain (PRRT_kwDOVPw2oc6uKOSA and PRRT_kwDOVPw2oc6uKOSL). Latest CodeRabbit review has no Outside diff range section. Remote head is current with main; strict health is clean. Plan: whole-file import privacy scanning with safe line diagnostics; exclude custom tracker storage from verification source text by resolved and real paths. Add synthetic real-tracker regressions, prove behavioural reverts independently, self-review related paths, and run unchanged full release gates before pushing."
  - created_at: "2026-10-20T02:48:41.094Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: "Implemented both verified findings. PRRT_kwDOVPw2oc6uKOSA: full decoded-file privacy preflight catches multiline assignments and authorization headers, preserves safe per-line diagnostics and uses a generic multiline location when needed. Tests cover every import harness, LF/CRLF, explicit email opt-in, mixed-file diagnostics and identical durable tracker bytes after refusal. PRRT_kwDOVPw2oc6uKOSL: source inventories exclude explicit tracker files by logical and real workspace paths, including custom directories, relative options, symlink aliases and roots inside the tracker; similarly named source siblings remain searchable. Self-review traced remember/import privacy entry points and CLI/SDK verification paths; no other split-line scanner or unbound verification caller exists in package operations."
  - created_at: "2026-10-20T02:48:42.341Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: "Behavioural revert proofs against parent 4852aa1: restored only importDir in src/transfer.ts, ran node --test --test-name-pattern=\"import refuses multiline\" test/review-r7.test.ts: 0 pass / 1 fail, Missing expected rejection. Restored fix; restored only evidence in src/verify.ts, ran node --test --test-name-pattern=\"verification excludes custom tracker\" test/review-r7.test.ts: 0 pass / 1 fail, stale count 0 instead of 1 because the tracker self-verified. Restored fix; node --test test/review-r7.test.ts: 3 pass / 0 fail. Tests import TypeScript sources directly; no stale dist involved."
  - created_at: "2026-10-20T02:59:48.008Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: "First full npm run release:check passed at unchanged thresholds: 143/143 suite tests and 2/2 packed npm/npx and Bun/bunx consumers; no failures, cancellations or skips. Coverage 100% statements/branches/functions/lines across 19 source files, 0% duplication (0/4516 lines across 39 sources), 82/82 declarations documented, production audit zero vulnerabilities, all 42 packed files allowlisted, changelog current, one publish invocation attested. PM-linked node --test test/review-r7.test.ts also passed 3/3; result tracking is disabled by existing policy so this comment preserves the receipt. Strict health passes all 10 checks, zero warnings; validation is ok for 9 items with the same 11 existing branch-provenance trust advisories. Isolated-identity npm and full Bun gates are pending on the same code snapshot."
  - created_at: "2026-10-20T03:06:21.600Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: "Validation attempt note: isolated npm and independent-clone Bun coverage overlapped. The unchanged adversarial JWT process test exceeded its existing five-second child deadline under contention (5089 ms); the initial full npm gate passed that test. Stopped both owned overlapping runs; interrupted runs are not acceptance evidence. Rerun the full isolated npm gate and full Bun gate sequentially without changing deadlines, coverage thresholds or source code."
  - created_at: "2026-10-20T03:06:35.757Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: "Correction to the preceding validation note: the JWT failure was assert.ok(elapsed < 500), the existing 500 ms measured scan threshold; 5089 ms was the total test duration, not a five-second child deadline. The child exited successfully; no process-deadline error was reported. The process uses a 15-second startup timer and a two-second post-ready timer. The contention diagnosis remains provisional until the unchanged sequential rerun passes. Preserve both this correction and the original attempt in append-only history."
  - created_at: "2026-10-20T03:19:03.865Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: "Sequential isolated acceptance passed: full npm run release:check with a fresh HOME, GIT_CONFIG_GLOBAL=/dev/null and GIT_CONFIG_NOSYSTEM=1 exited 0. Suite 143/143; packed consumers 2/2; failures/cancellations/skips all zero; 19 measured sources and 100% coverage in every dimension; production audit zero; 42 allowlisted packed files. All three adversarial scan tests passed unchanged, including the 500 ms JWT assertion that failed during the overlapping attempt. Independent git clone --no-local of code commit 3ebe34c passed strict health: 10 checks, zero warnings. The full Bun gate now runs alone in that clone. No source, dependency pin, deadline or coverage threshold changed for the rerun."
  - created_at: "2026-10-20T03:21:48.947Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: "Final self-review found and corrected an overbroad exclusion in the first review fix: tracker file names must remain in the suffix index for explicit path-existence claims, while their contents must not establish symbol/flag evidence. This preserves the accepted tracker-runtime path contract. The expanded synthetic custom-tracker regression includes a runtime path claim alongside absent symbols, valid source symbols, prefix siblings and workspace aliases. Verified failure against evidence from 3ebe34c: node --test --test-name-pattern=\"verification excludes custom tracker\" test/review-r7.test.ts fails with stale count 2 instead of 1. Separating path inventory from text inventory restores the legitimate path claim. Earlier full gates on 3ebe34c are preliminary evidence, superseded by this source correction; stopped the Bun run on that superseded snapshot. Rerun both complete release gates sequentially on the corrected snapshot."
  - created_at: "2026-10-20T03:21:52.445Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: "Repeated behavioural proofs with the strengthened final regression: reverting only importDir to 4852aa1 yields Missing expected rejection (0 pass / 1 fail); reverting only evidence to 4852aa1 yields stale count 0 instead of 1 (0 pass / 1 fail); reverting only evidence to 3ebe34c yields stale count 2 instead of 1 (0 pass / 1 fail). Exact commands: node --test --test-name-pattern=\"import refuses multiline\" test/review-r7.test.ts and node --test --test-name-pattern=\"verification excludes custom tracker\" test/review-r7.test.ts. Restored focused suite passes 3/3; typecheck passed. All reverts were isolated to the named function, and tests import source directly."
  - created_at: "2026-10-20T03:32:17.178Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: "Final corrected source snapshot 820b7ea: isolated npm run release:check completed with exit 0. Suite 143/143, packed npm/npx and Bun/bunx consumers 2/2, zero failures/cancellations/skips. Coverage 100% statements/branches/functions/lines over 19 files; 0% duplication (0/4519 lines across 39 sources); 82/82 declarations documented; production audit zero; 42 allowlisted packed files; changelog current; one publish invocation attested. Corrected snapshot independent-clone strict health passes 10/10 with zero warnings. PM-linked node --test test/review-r7.test.ts on the strengthened final tests passes 3/3, with result tracking disabled by existing policy. Full Bun release gate is running sequentially on the same corrected snapshot. Earlier interrupted or superseded gates are not counted as final acceptance."
  - created_at: "2026-10-20T03:39:45.816Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: "Final acceptance on corrected source 820b7ea: both full npm run release:check under isolated HOME/Git identity and full bun run release:check in an independent clone exited 0. Each ran 143/143 suite tests and 2/2 packed npm/npx and Bun/bunx consumers, with zero failures/cancellations/skips. Both measured all 19 intended source files at 100% statements/branches/functions/lines, 0% duplication across 39 sources (0/4519 lines), 82 documented declarations, zero production vulnerabilities, 42 allowlisted packed files, current changelog and one attested publish invocation. The packed artifact hash agreed across final gates. Final PM-linked regressions pass 3/3; three isolated behavioural reversions fail as intended. Both original unresolved findings are valid and fixed. Self-review preserved explicit tracker path evidence while excluding tracker text. No private memory data accessed or copied, no thread replies or resolutions, no merge or release. No new pm CLI/SDK defect found. Existing development-only advisory remains on pm-memory-eafx; dependency pins unchanged. Release this claim for orchestrator verification without closing the item; exact pushed head will be checked in CI and an independent clone."
  - created_at: "2026-10-20T04:20:25.134Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: "Review round: fetched all review threads and comments at head b8c1289; exactly three unresolved threads (PRRT_kwDOVPw2oc6uMSRi, PRRT_kwDOVPw2oc6uMSRo, PRRT_kwDOVPw2oc6uMSRv), no pagination gaps. Latest substantive CodeRabbit review has no Outside diff range section. All findings verified valid. Plan: actionable memory_merge conflicts, refuse remember writes to index artifacts, require positive child test pass counts; real-tracker regressions and behavioral revert proofs, self-review, unchanged npm/Bun and isolated-identity release gates."
  - created_at: "2026-10-20T04:21:53.068Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: "All three review findings fixed. PRRT_kwDOVPw2oc6uMSRi: both mergeReceipt refusal paths identify the source and memory_merge with audited pm update recovery; valid destinations are named and unavailable destinations use a safe label. PRRT_kwDOVPw2oc6uMSRo: remember rejects every imported index artifact slug before schema/history/content writes, including explicit update, forceNew and canceled artifacts. PRRT_kwDOVPw2oc6uMSRv: child assertions require a positive pass count AND the expected test name; Node 24 reports a file-level pass even for an empty name selection, so count alone is insufficient. Self-review covered all remember selectors and artifact lifecycle states, malformed/null/legacy receipts, dry-run refusals, safe destination diagnostics, and other filtered child test invocations; no additional affected filtered invocation was found."
  - created_at: "2026-10-20T04:21:53.783Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: "Behavioral revert proofs (each restored immediately): node --test --test-name-pattern=\"pending merge refusals\" test/review-r8.test.ts with only mergeReceipt reverted to b8c1289 failed the source-identification assertion (exit 1); node --test --test-name-pattern=\"remember refuses index artifact\" test/review-r8.test.ts with only remember reverted failed Missing expected rejection (exit 1); node --test --test-name-pattern=\"child test assertions\" test/review-r8.test.ts with only assertTestsPassed reduced to the prior status-only behavior failed Missing expected exception (exit 1). Fixed focused run: node --test test/review-r8.test.ts test/review-r5.test.ts passed 10/10, zero failures, skips or cancellations. New real-tracker regressions prove refusal leaves durable bytes unchanged and imported index export byte-identical; no SDK mocks or private corpus used."
  - created_at: "2026-10-20T04:27:13.271Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: "Final round acceptance: npm run release:check passed normally and with isolated HOME/Git identity; bun run release:check passed with isolated HOME/Git identity. All three full runs exited 0 at unchanged thresholds, each with 146/146 suite tests and 2/2 packed npm/npx and Bun/bunx consumer tests, zero failures/cancellations/skips. All 19 intended source files measured at 100% statements/branches/functions/lines (1923 statements/lines, 1185 branches, 99 functions). Duplication 0% (0/4598 lines across 40 sources); all 82 declarations documented; production vulnerabilities zero; 42 allowlisted packed files; matching packed artifact hashes; changelog current and one publish invocation attested. PM-linked focused regressions passed 10/10; all three behavioral revert proofs failed as intended. Strict health passed 10/10 with zero warnings. Validation passes all 9 items with 11 existing branch-provenance advisories. Existing development-only advisory remains on pm-memory-eafx; no new PM CLI/SDK bug found. No pins, workflow, template or thresholds changed. No private corpus accessed, no thread replies/resolutions, no merge or release. Release claim and retain in_progress for orchestrator verification; verify the committed head in an independent clone before push."
  - created_at: "2026-10-20T05:09:39.676Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: "Review round at head 6c1c28e: fetched all unresolved threads and all their comments with complete pagination. Three findings remain: overlapping consolidation roles, repeated recall packet serialization, and excluded context files falsely establishing symbol absence. Latest CodeRabbit review has no Outside diff range section. Plan: causal regression tests, one randomized action-role invariant, self-review related logic, unchanged npm and Bun release gates, isolated identity gate, explicit staging and push."
  - created_at: "2026-10-20T05:12:25.209Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: "Verified all three unresolved threads. PRRT_kwDOVPw2oc6uM_57: proposals now reserve each action endpoint once, with link-only supersession before merge/archive selection. PRRT_kwDOVPw2oc6uM_6A: recallPacket accounts each fully rendered prefix/excerpt candidate once. PRRT_kwDOVPw2oc6uM_6F: symbol absence requires a context in the actual searched file set. New test/review-r9.test.ts passes 4/4: randomized invariant covers 500 deterministic memory sets and 2250 actions; packet serialization counts for 12/24/48 rows are 72/124/265."
  - created_at: "2026-10-20T05:12:28.086Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: "Behavioral revert proofs on test/review-r9.test.ts: reverting only proposals to head 6c1c28e makes node --test --test-name-pattern='stale supersession sources|randomized consolidation invariant' test/review-r9.test.ts fail 2/2; randomized sample 0 repeats one endpoint in archive and supersedes. Reverting only recallPacket makes node --test --test-name-pattern='recall accounts complete candidates' test/review-r9.test.ts fail 1/1: 12 rows require 622 packet serializations versus 72 fixed. Reverting only checkClaim makes node --test --test-name-pattern='excluded context files' test/review-r9.test.ts fail 1/1: excluded Markdown context returns stale instead of unknown. All fixed functions restored after each proof."
  - created_at: "2026-10-20T05:14:25.486Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: "Self-review found the same endpoint conflict possible in durable pending receipts. Added preflight refusal for overlapping or self-referential pending merges, before registration, links, comments or writes. Real tracker regression captures an actual merge receipt and constructs both conflicting cases; dry-run and apply refuse with unchanged tracker bytes. Reverting only consolidate makes node --test --test-name-pattern='pending merge endpoints' test/review-r9.test.ts fail 1/1 (missing rejection), then restored. Focused suite now passes 5/5. Architecture documents accounting, searched contexts, deterministic endpoint reservation and pending recovery refusals."
  - created_at: "2026-10-20T05:20:15.186Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: "Final review-round acceptance: normal npm run release:check, isolated HOME/Git npm run release:check, and isolated HOME/Git bun run release:check each passed all 12 stages, 151/151 suite tests and 2/2 real packed npm/npx and Bun/bunx consumers, with zero suite failures, cancellations or skips. Coverage is 100% statements/branches/functions/lines across all 19 intended source files: 1945 statements/lines, 1209 branches, 100 functions. Duplication is 0% (0/4751 lines across 41 sources), all 83 declarations documented, production vulnerabilities zero, all 42 packed files allowlisted. PM-linked regressions pass 5/5. All four behavioral function revert proofs failed as intended. Randomized invariant passes 500 deterministic memory sets, 2250 actions, no repeated endpoint."
  - created_at: "2026-10-20T05:20:16.284Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: "Final self-review covers every changed source function and related consolidation, packet-accounting and context-evidence paths. No unresolved finding rejected. Latest substantive review has no Outside diff range section. Strict PM health passes 10/10 with zero warnings; validation passes all 9 items with the same 11 existing branch-provenance advisories. Existing development-only advisories remain tracked on pm-memory-eafx. No new PM CLI/SDK defect found; one incorrect files invocation was corrected using the supported glob option. Existing history remains byte-prefix intact, new tracked content contains no absolute local paths, and no private corpus was accessed. No dependency pins, workflows or thresholds changed. Release claim and retain in_progress for orchestrator verification. Verify committed-head identity and strict health in an independent clone before push; leave threads untouched and do not merge or release."
  - created_at: "2026-10-20T06:07:09.748Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: "Review round 10: fetched every unresolved thread with complete comments. Verified PRRT_kwDOVPw2oc6uNtb4 (verify skipped return documentation) and PRRT_kwDOVPw2oc6uNtb7 (generated links to canceled or artifact memories). Latest CodeRabbit review contains no Outside diff range findings. Will add regression and behavioral revert proofs, audit export reference closure and SDK contracts, and run unchanged npm/Bun release gates."
  - created_at: "2026-10-20T06:11:10.471Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: "Self-review verified all eight SDK signatures against README and inspected all export paths. Extended the link fix to retained source references, canonical names changed by AGENTS directory export, ambiguous aliases, and projected re-import slug collisions. Valid source aliases preserve bytes; missing targets become plain text and repairs reduce byte_preserved. Export stays read-only for the tracker and collision refusal precedes publication. Synthetic tests re-import both output harnesses with zero unresolved links."
  - created_at: "2026-10-20T06:12:47.157Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: "Behavioral revert proofs (scratch copy, tests unchanged): reverting only generated() to the remote-head implementation makes node --test --test-name-pattern \"generated exports\" test/review-r10.test.ts fail 0 pass/1 fail on archived/artifact output; reverting exportedReferences() to identity makes --test-name-pattern \"preserved and revised\" fail 0/1 on the repaired byte-preservation receipt; removing only projected slug collision validation makes --test-name-pattern \"export removes ambiguous\" fail 0/1 with Missing expected rejection; restoring only the previous README makes --test-name-pattern \"SDK documentation\" fail 0/1 on the missing skipped contract. Every mutant exited 1 with an assertion failure. Restored implementation passes all 4 new tests. Thread mapping: PRRT_kwDOVPw2oc6uNtb4 -> SDK contract; PRRT_kwDOVPw2oc6uNtb7 -> generated active-fact links plus full export reference closure."
  - created_at: "2026-10-20T06:17:05.513Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: "Stable-source normal npm run release:check passed all 12 stages: 155/155 suite tests and 2/2 packed npm/npx and Bun/bunx consumer tests, zero failures/cancellations/skips. Coverage: 1968/1968 statements and lines, 1237/1237 branches, 101/101 functions across 19 intended source files (100% each). Duplication 0/4867 lines across 42 sources; all 84 declarations documented; production audit zero vulnerabilities; 42 packed files allowlisted. Final-source behavioral revert proofs repeated successfully, each 0 pass/1 assertion failure. Source/tests/docs/dependency hashes frozen for remaining gates. Existing history prefixes preserved. Proceeding with Bun and isolated HOME/Git npm gates before push."
